reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.melee_efficiency=Melee Efficiency
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.melee_efficiency.desc=Melee attacks cost 1 less stamina.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.ranged_efficiency=Ranged Efficiency
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.ranged_efficiency.desc=Bows cost 1 less stamina to draw and drain stamina more slowly while held, as do thrown weapons.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.shield_efficiency=Shield Efficiency
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.shield_efficiency.desc=Raised shields drain stamina half as often.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.adrenaline=Adrenaline
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.adrenaline.desc=Taking damage while below 3 stamina restores up to 20 stamina. 20 second cooldown.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.expert_climber=Expert Climber
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.expert_climber.desc=Climbing, clinging, ledges, and grappling cost 1 less stamina.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.marathon_runner=Marathon Runner
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.marathon_runner.desc=Sprinting and jumping count as moving, not strenuous activity, for stamina refill. Walking refills as fast as resting.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.cardio_master=Cardio Master
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.cardio_master.desc=Stamina refills as fast as when you are moving while you are sprinting, climbing, fighting or doing other strenuous activity.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.mining_expert=Mining Expert
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.mining_expert.desc=Your pickaxes harvest as if they were diamond tier. Speed and durability still come from the tool.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.evasion=Evasion
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.evasion.desc=Spend dodge stamina to cancel a hit from a living attacker. 30 second cooldown.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.respite=Respite
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.respite.desc=Once per minute, a lethal hit leaves you standing with Regeneration II and Defence for 5 seconds. Does not save you from the void. Can be toggled on and off.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.power_attack=Power Attack
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.power_attack.desc=A full stamina bar empowers medium and heavy melee hits for extra damage and extra stamina cost. Can be toggled on and off.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.armor_mastery=Armor Mastery
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.armor_mastery.desc=Reduces the weight stamina penalty of all worn armor pieces by 1.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.mining_efficiency=Mining Efficiency
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.mining_efficiency.desc=Mining and digging use 25%% less stamina.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.precision_shot=Precision Shot
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.precision_shot.desc=A fully drawn bow shot deals double damage.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.herbalist=Herbalist
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.herbalist.desc=Always harvest one extra from magical and apothecary plants.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.gathering_efficiency=Gathering Efficiency
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.gathering_efficiency.desc=Chopping logs, breaking leaves and gravel and cutting trees use 25%% less stamina. Plants are not affected.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.bountiful_harvest=Bountiful Harvest
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.bountiful_harvest.desc=Mature food crops always drop one extra. Does not affect melons, pumpkins, or magical herbs.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.rancher=Rancher
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.rancher.desc=Tended animals nearby grow, breed, drink, and produce faster. Milk still costs a bucket.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.drafter=Drafter
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.drafter.desc=Unlocks Effortless Building lines, walls, floors, and diagonals.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.sculptor=Sculptor
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.sculptor.desc=Unlocks Effortless Building circles, cylinders, spheres, and cubes.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.reach1=Reach I
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.reach1.desc=Effortless Building build modes reach about 7 blocks.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.reach2=Reach II
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.reach2.desc=Effortless Building build modes reach about 15 blocks. Requires Reach I.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.reach3=Reach III
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.reach3.desc=Effortless Building build modes reach about 30 blocks. Requires Reach II.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.transpose=Transpose
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.transpose.desc=Unlocks Effortless Building quick replace.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.vis_thrift=Vis Thrift
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.vis_thrift.desc=Foci and the Arcane Workbench spend 30%% less vis.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.quiet_mind=Quiet Mind
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.quiet_mind.desc=Warp incidents are milder. Some fail to take hold at all.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.glass_cutter=Glass Cutter
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.glass_cutter.desc=Breaking glass and glass panes drops the block itself.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.herd_abundance=Herd Abundance
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.herd_abundance.desc=Shearing sheep or goats yields extra wool. Collecting nests with an empty hand yields an extra egg.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.iron_gut=Iron Gut
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.iron_gut.desc=Alcoholic drinks no longer make you tipsy. Thirst and drink quality still apply.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.water_collector=Water Collector
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.water_collector.desc=Bottles and canteens filled from water sources are purified. Drinking straight from water will not give you Thirst or parasites.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.full_font=Full Font
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.full_font.desc=Casting a focus from a nearly full aura costs 50%% more vis and empowers your next spell by 50%%. Can be toggled on and off.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.blood_pact=Blood Pact
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.blood_pact.desc=Lose four hearts. Your magic damage and healing spells are doubled.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.druid=Druid
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.druid.desc=Mana costs 30%% less. Generating flowers near you make 15%% more mana. Exclusive with Witch, Astromancer, and Artificer.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.mana_veil=Mana Veil
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.mana_veil.desc=Spend mana to absorb 20%% of a hit (1000 mana per health point). Requires Druid.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.living_edge=Living Edge
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.living_edge.desc=Botania weapons and bursts deal 15%% more damage. Requires Druid.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.witch=Witch
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.witch.desc=Rituals drain 30%% less power. Nearby altars gain 15%% more from decorations. Exclusive with Druid, Astromancer, and Artificer.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.cold_iron_mind=Cold Iron Mind
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.cold_iron_mind.desc=Warp gained from finishing a ritual is halved. Requires Witch.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.stitch=Stitch
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.stitch.desc=Poppets survive one extra hit. Repair any poppet with witches' stitching. Requires Witch.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.astromancer=Astromancer
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.astromancer.desc=Altar crafts spend 30%% less starlight and finish 25%% faster. Exclusive with Druid, Witch, and Artificer.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.astral_warmth=Astral Warmth
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.astral_warmth.desc=Your body temperature cannot drop into dangerous cold. Requires Astromancer.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.star_powered=Star Powered
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.star_powered.desc=Under open night sky, you deal 25%% more damage and gain Regeneration and faster stamina recovery. Requires Astromancer.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.artificer=Artificer
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.artificer.desc=Ember costs 30%% less. Nearby stampers, mixers, and melters run 25%% faster. Exclusive with Druid, Witch, and Astromancer.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.live_spark=Live Spark
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.live_spark.desc=Ember attacks deal 20%% more damage. Requires Artificer.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.cinder_ward=Cinder Ward
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.cinder_ward.desc=Your body temperature cannot overheat. Fire hits deal 20%% less damage, or heal you if you have Fire Resistance. Requires Artificer.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.benevolent=Benevolent
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.benevolent.desc=Healing another living creature restores twice as much. Healing yourself is unchanged.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.dark_vision=Dark Vision
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.dark_vision.desc=Darkness is slightly easier to see through, and you spot hidden mobs as Night Vision does. Can be toggled on and off.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.spelunker=Spelunker
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.spelunker.desc=Underground, warp fills at half rate and your body temperature moves toward comfort.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.tunnel_sense=Tunnel Sense
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.tunnel_sense.desc=Hostiles within 10 blocks ping and glow for 5 seconds on a 5 second cooldown. Can be toggled on and off.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.prospector=Prospector
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.prospector.desc=Increases Prospecting Pick accuracy by 25%% and outlines detected ores. Better quality picks also detect ores more accurately.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.motherlode=Motherlode
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.motherlode.desc=Ore breaks can add one extra ore. The chance grows with Mining.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.lithomancy=Lithomancy
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.lithomancy.desc=Any ore can drop a Rare Earth. The chance grows with Mining. Silk Touch blocks it.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.stone_cleaver=Stone Cleaver
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.stone_cleaver.desc=Diamond-tier picks and better lose no durability on stone, cobble, or gravel.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.lumberjack=Lumberjack
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.lumberjack.desc=Logs and whole felled trees break twice as fast, halving the stamina cost.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.heartwood=Heartwood
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.heartwood.desc=Log breaks can add one extra log, including when felling whole trees. The chance grows with Gathering.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.forager=Forager
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.forager.desc=Breaking grass, flowers, crops, mushrooms and other plants costs no stamina.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.reforester=Reforester
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.reforester.desc=Broken leaves can drop a sapling of that tree. The chance grows with Gathering. A felled tree gives at most one stack. Shears and Silk Touch still take the leaf.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.sifter=Sifter
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.sifter.desc=Gravel keeps its gravel and can add flint. Clay can add a clay ball. The chance grows with Gathering.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.wood_splitter=Wood Splitter
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.wood_splitter.desc=Diamond-tier axes and better lose no durability on logs.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.orchard=Orchard
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.orchard.desc=Melons, pumpkins, vine tomatoes, and ripe tree fruit can drop one extra. The chance grows with Farming.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.sower=Sower
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.sower.desc=Right-click farmland to plant a 3 by 3, one seed per block. Can be toggled on and off.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.husbandry=Husbandry
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.husbandry.desc=Babies within 16 blocks grow up faster and can breed again sooner.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.hearty_meal=Hearty Meal
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.hearty_meal.desc=Food restores 2 extra hunger.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.seed_harvester=Seed Harvester
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.seed_harvester.desc=Mature crops can drop one extra seed. The chance grows with Farming.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.finisher=Finisher
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.finisher.desc=Melee hits deal 50%% more damage to a mob below one quarter health.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.aura_breaker=Aura Breaker
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.aura_breaker.desc=Melee hits apply Broken Magic Shield III for 5 seconds.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.bleeding_edge=Bleeding Edge
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.bleeding_edge.desc=Melee hits apply bleeding for 16 seconds. The target takes damage while it moves.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.pinning_shot=Pinning Shot
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.pinning_shot.desc=Arrows and thrown weapons apply Slowness II for 2 seconds.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.opportunistic=Opportunistic
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.opportunistic.desc=Melee against a target another creature hit in the last 3 seconds uses your stealth attack.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.fortify=Fortify
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.fortify.desc=A raised shield costs no stamina. Standing still while blocking grants Resistance II.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.unyielding=Unyielding
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.unyielding.desc=A raised shield gives full knockback resistance from any direction.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.awareness=Awareness
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.awareness.desc=You do not take extra damage from a stealth melee hit.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.fast_revive=Fast Revive
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.fast_revive.desc=You revive downed players twice as fast.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.taunt=Taunt
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.taunt.desc=You generate twice as much threat. Locks out Low Profile. Can be toggled on and off.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.low_profile=Low Profile
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.low_profile.desc=You generate 25%% less threat. Locks out Taunt. Can be toggled on and off.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.soft_step=Soft Step
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.soft_step.desc=You do not trample crops.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.tumble=Tumble
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.tumble.desc=Fall damage is halved.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.slow_fall=Slow Fall
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.slow_fall.desc=Falling beside a solid wall slows your fall. Open shafts do not.
