aqtweaks.manarepair.tooltip=Mana-Weave: repairs and protects itself with mana
research.MANA_REPAIR.title=Mana-Weaving
research.MANA_REPAIR.stage.1=Botania's manasteel mends itself from the mana its bearer carries. Perhaps the same trick can be woven into other implements through the infusion altar, if the altar is fed a manasteel piece of the same kind and a tablet brimming with mana.
research.MANA_REPAIR.stage.2=Infuse a tool, weapon, shield or armor piece with the matching manasteel item, a full Mana Tablet (500,000 mana, consumed), a Rune of Mana, a Mana Pearl, a Mana Diamond, Salis Mundus and two Thaumium Ingots. Items with no manasteel cousin take a Manasteel Block instead. The infused item repairs a point per tick while its bearer has mana, at Botania's price, and spends mana to avoid wear. Armor repairs only while worn.
