reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.riposte=Riposte
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.riposte.desc=Warrior class perk. A shield raised just before a hit costs no stamina and staggers the attacker for half a second. Works with every shield, Aegis included.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.steady_draw=Steady Draw
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.steady_draw.desc=Archer class perk. Drawing a bow costs no stamina until full draw, and most arrows that hit return to the ground at the target's feet.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.fleetfoot=Fleetfoot
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.fleetfoot.desc=Scout class perk. Sneak much faster, sprint faster with a light weapon or empty hands, and the first three seconds of a sprint cost no stamina.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.vein_rhythm=Vein Rhythm
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.vein_rhythm.desc=Miner class perk. Breaking stone and ore in quick succession builds momentum: up to five stacks of faster pickaxe work that fade when you pause.
aqtweaks.perk.riposte.name=Riposte
aqtweaks.perk.riposte.desc=A shield raised just before a hit costs no stamina and staggers the attacker.
aqtweaks.perk.steady_draw.name=Steady Draw
aqtweaks.perk.steady_draw.desc=Drawing a bow costs no stamina, and most arrows that hit are recovered.
aqtweaks.perk.fleetfoot.name=Fleetfoot
aqtweaks.perk.fleetfoot.desc=Faster sneaking and light-weapon sprinting, and a free start to every sprint.
aqtweaks.perk.vein_rhythm.name=Vein Rhythm
aqtweaks.perk.vein_rhythm.desc=Quick pickaxe breaks build momentum and mine faster.
