# Studious (Scholar class perk) and Hearthkeeper (Homesteader class perk)
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.studious=Studious
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.studious.desc=Scholar class perk. Theorycrafting offers three extra cards (Eureka, Cross-Reference, Second Opinion), and your focus cooldowns are 25%% shorter.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.hearthkeeper=Hearthkeeper
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.hearthkeeper.desc=Homesteader class perk. Friends near you rest easier and you gain comfort from their company. Your home gives everyone resting in it extra comfort and a longer Rested.
aqtweaks.perk.studious.name=Studious
aqtweaks.perk.studious.desc=Three extra theorycrafting cards, and focus cooldowns 25%% shorter.
aqtweaks.perk.hearthkeeper.name=Hearthkeeper
aqtweaks.perk.hearthkeeper.desc=Others nearby rest easier, your home is cozier for everyone in it, and Rested lingers longer there.
aqtweaks.card.eureka.name=Eureka
aqtweaks.card.eureka.text=Your work on one discipline finally clicks. Adds %s progress to your leading category.
aqtweaks.card.cross_reference.name=Cross-Reference
aqtweaks.card.cross_reference.text=Connect the threads between your fields. Adds %s progress to each category you already have progress in, up to %s.
aqtweaks.card.second_opinion.name=Second Opinion
aqtweaks.card.second_opinion.text=Step back and ask again. Adds %s progress to your leading category and widens the next draw with an extra card.

