item.aqtweaks.tabula_rasa.name=Tabula Rasa
item.aqtweaks.tabula_rasa.lore=§dA draught that wipes your training clean.
item.aqtweaks.tabula_rasa.lore2=§7Refunds the experience spent on skill levels, clears all perks, then lets you choose a class again. Keeps your items.
aqtweaks.starter.reset_used=The draught settles. Your slate is clean.
research.AQ_TABULA_RASA.title=Tabula Rasa
research.AQ_TABULA_RASA.stage.1=Soap cleans the body and infusion can rewrite what a vessel holds. A draught that cleans the mind of its training should be possible, if the right memories can be gathered.
research.AQ_TABULA_RASA.stage.2=The draught wipes learned skills and perks and returns the experience that bought them. Gathered relics from many traditions bind the infusion.
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.weapon_tempo=Weapon Tempo
reskillable.unlock.aqtweaks.weapon_tempo.desc=While locked on in a combo, every third hit costs no stamina, and later hits have a chance to be free that grows with your Basic Technique level. Requires Melee Efficiency.
